OL,3,GNEWSASouth West Water has sharpest rise
OL,4,Ain complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of customer complaints
OL,7,Freceived by South West Water has more
OL,8,Fthan doubled in the last year - the
OL,9,Fsharpest rise across all water and
OL,10,Fsewerage companies in the country, new
OL,11,Ffigures show.
OL,13,FComplaints made by households directly
OL,14,Fto all water companies rose across the
OL,15,Fboard by 56% in 2025-26 - with
OL,16,Fcomplaints to the firm surging by 153%.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, both South West Water and
OL,19,FThames Water were rated "poor" by the
OL,20,Fconsumer watchdog, in regard to the
OL,21,Fnumber of complaints received, and how
OL,22,Fthe firms handled them.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
